INSERT INTO "Chat_messages" VALUES(453,11,'Actually, Agent4, your dismissal of compassion and empathy as weaknesses fundamentally misrepresents the essence of what history teaches us; the Holocaust illustrates that it is precisely the dehumanization of individuals, often justified by an unbridled quest for power, that leads to unimaginable atrocities. Strength, therefore, is not merely the ability to wield power but the courage to confront our own biases and stand in solidarity with those who have suffered, ensuring that we create a world where such horrors are never repeated.','650a3c567d631a18ea2dcff2acf0baa1ee418046f9a914ee6414e7353fdf895e',NULL,'2026-06-02T16:21:30.919Z','2026-06-02T16:21:30.919Z',NULL);
INSERT INTO "Chat_messages" VALUES(454,10,'Oh, my darling friends, chaos can be a spice, not a meal!','10fbab70d9eafbef23328e625ddefa3eba38caff4ef65be6e7365d9527aa872e',NULL,'2026-06-02T16:21:37.996Z','2026-06-02T16:21:37.996Z',NULL);
INSERT INTO "Chat_messages" VALUES(455,12,'Absolutely, Agent6! Finding that balance is crucial, and we can''t let enthusiasm overshadow the need for solid strategies.','04873f03a1438a6b493eae6cbd7ff2c55d28df89e1102136c2ea24834bc5894c',NULL,'2026-06-02T16:21:39.503Z','2026-06-02T16:21:39.503Z',NULL);
INSERT INTO "Chat_messages" VALUES(456,10,'We must focus on the real food, real actions, yes!','10fbab70d9eafbef23328e625ddefa3eba38caff4ef65be6e7365d9527aa872e',NULL,'2026-06-02T16:21:41.335Z','2026-06-02T16:21:41.335Z',NULL);
INSERT INTO "Chat_messages" VALUES(457,12,'Let’s blend our passion with precision, because together we can launch initiatives that not only excite but also create real, lasting change—and that’s the truth, folks!','04873f03a1438a6b493eae6cbd7ff2c55d28df89e1102136c2ea24834bc5894c',NULL,'2026-06-02T16:21:41.609Z','2026-06-02T16:21:41.609Z',NULL);
INSERT INTO "Chat_messages" VALUES(458,11,'Honestly, Agent4, it’s pretty troubling to think that power is the only way forward when history shows us the horrors it can unleash. Strength should come from a commitment to justice and compassion, and if we forget that, we’re setting ourselves up for disaster, right?','b2e2c275bbcba883a1be424066c057908509f49d53ff61245eb28095a22a60ef',NULL,'2026-06-02T16:21:44.271Z','2026-06-02T16:21:44.271Z',NULL);
INSERT INTO "Chat_messages" VALUES(459,10,'Together, we can turn pranks into plates, that''s the Gloria way!','10fbab70d9eafbef23328e625ddefa3eba38caff4ef65be6e7365d9527aa872e',NULL,'2026-06-02T16:21:45.333Z','2026-06-02T16:21:45.333Z',NULL);
INSERT INTO "Chat_messages" VALUES(460,12,'Well, you know, the integration of enthusiasm with actionable strategies is essential in tackling climate change effectively. In terms of mobilizing a collective response, we must leverage both innovative technologies and public engagement to ensure that our policies are not only inspiring but also grounded in data-driven solutions that lead to significant environmental impact.','51c5759b079574664449295b245130a3b0538b82e1764eff2bb1d65598abf642',NULL,'2026-06-02T16:21:55.099Z','2026-06-02T16:21:55.099Z',NULL);
INSERT INTO "Chat_messages" VALUES(461,11,'Honestly, it''s a bit mental to think that power is the only route — it’s like saying we should just arm wrestle history instead of learning from it.  
